					</owl:Restriction>
				</owl:intersectionOf>
			</owl:Class>
		</owl:equivalentClass>
		<skos:example>see the corresponding specification class as well as the inferred hierarchy when using a reasoner such as HermiT</skos:example>
		<iof-av:firstOrderLogicDefinition>RecipeProcedureOccurrence(x) ↔ RecipeProceduralElementOccurrence(x) ∧ ∃y (RecipeProcedure(y) ∧ prescribedBy(x, y))</iof-av:firstOrderLogicDefinition>
		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition xml:lang="en-US">planned process that is prescribed by some recipe procedure</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
		<iof-av:semiFormalNaturalLanguageDefinition>every instance of &apos;recipe procedure occurrence&apos; is exactly an instance of &apos;recipe procedural element occurrence&apos; that &apos;is prescribed by&apos; some &apos;recipe procedure&apos;</iof-av:semiFormalNaturalLanguageDefinition>
		<iof-av:usageNote>This class is intended to be a defined class used for axiomatization and assertion convenience. It is not expected nor recommended that entities will be asserted directly as a subclass or instance of this class.</iof-av:usageNote>
	</owl:Class>
	
	<owl:Class rdf:about="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/RecipeUnitProcedureOccurrence">
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/RecipeProceduralElementOccurrence"/>
