		<iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition xml:lang="en-US">planned process that is prescribed by some recipe unit procedure</iof-av:naturalLanguageDefinition>
		<iof-av:semiFormalNaturalLanguageDefinition>every instance of &apos;recipe unit procedure occurrence&apos; is exactly an instance of &apos;recipe procedural element occurrence&apos; that &apos;is prescribed by&apos; some &apos;recipe unit procedure&apos;</iof-av:semiFormalNaturalLanguageDefinition>
